<% page title: "About", description: "What Culture Studio is, the record behind it, and Crafty Machine LLC." %>
<section class="wrap pt-20">
  <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h1>
</section>

<section class="wrap mt-12 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-4 sm:gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr]">
  <h2 class="eyebrow pt-2">The studio</h2>
  <div class="prose-cm">
    <p>
      Culture Studio is a network of applications and businesses that support humanity.
      It works across three fields: software and technology, hospitality, and community organizing.
    </p>
    <p>
      The studio brings more than two decades of building digital products. Its earlier work
      includes HaveMyShift, a shift-swapping service for hourly workers that went through
      Techstars Boston and swapped more than 10,000 shifts, and Fresh Metrix, an SEO tool.
      What runs today is on the <a href="<%= path("work/") %>">Work</a> page.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="eyebrow mt-8 pt-2 sm:mt-0">The company</h2>
  <div class="prose-cm">
    <p>
      <%= Site::COMPANY %> is a Delaware company, and the legal name behind Culture Studio.
      The people behind it are on the <a href="<%= path("team/") %>">Team</a> page.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
